# Clinic data exports. A real Jane appointment export carries patient names,
# GUIDs, chart status and visit notes, and this repository is public — so the
# contents are ignored outright rather than case by case. The README stays
# tracked so the folder survives a fresh clone and explains itself.
csvs/*
!csvs/README.md

# Backstop for exports that land somewhere other than csvs/. If you ever need
# to commit a genuine fixture, force it: git add -f path/to/fixture.csv
*.csv
